## ✅ `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Virtual environment
venv/
.env
*.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Audio recordings
audio/*.wav

# Model cache (optional)
*.safetensors
*.bin

# VSCode
.vscode/

# Logs
*.log

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

